# FINANCIAL AUTHORITY STOP

**Financial Authority v2 is RED.**

Full freeze: [docs/ARK-FINANCIAL-AUTHORITY-V2.md](../../docs/ARK-FINANCIAL-AUTHORITY-V2.md)

## Gate (every proposal / PR)

Any work that touches estimates, invoices, payments, deposits, coverage, or customer balances must answer first:

> **Does this belong to F1 (Financial Position), or is it blocked by Financial Authority v2?**

If the answer is invoice refresh, invoice sync, early invoice, or living invoice — **it does not proceed.**

## Permitted

- **F1 Financial Position only**
- Money-loss bugfixes that do **not** expand living-invoice doctrine

## Blocked

- Invoice synchronization
- Refresh Invoice
- Early invoice issuance
- Living invoice enhancements
- Invoice UI redesign
- Invoice generation changes
- Deposit-driven invoice behavior
- Financial patches that bypass Financial Position

Existing living-invoice behavior is **transitional compatibility only**.

## Until F1 is intentionally resumed

Leave financials alone. Focus on shop daily workflow or customer experience.

## One question per financial surface

| Surface | Primary question |
| --- | --- |
| Estimate | What has the customer approved? |
| Financial Position | What does the customer owe if we finished now? |
| Ledger | What money has moved? |
| Issue Final Invoice | Is this repair ready to become a financial record? |
| Final Invoice | What was billed? |
| Receipt | What was paid? |

## Resume order

F0 ✅ → **F1** (only) → F2 → F3 → F4 → F5 → F6. Never reverse. Authority stays RED until F1 completes.
